    {
      "name": "send_message",
      "description": "Send an Instagram DM, a sender action (typing/seen), or a private reply to a comment from the connected account. Body shape switches by intent: (1) text DM — recipient={id:IGSID}, message={text}; (2) media DM — message={attachment:{type,payload:{url}}}; (3) private reply to a public comment — recipient={comment_id}, which is the only way to initiate to someone who hasn't messaged first (7-day single-use window); (4) sender action — recipient={id}, sender_action='typing_on'|'mark_seen'. Standard recipients are bound by Meta's 24-hour messaging window unless an approved tag applies. Calls POST /{ig-user-id}/messages.",
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/{{credential.user_id}}/messages",
      "input_schema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
